    "content": [
     {
      "text": "redeemed -- Heb. \"goel,\" Redemp. (Kinsman type). (See Scofield \"Isaiah 59:20\")."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "verse",
    "number": 12,
    "content": [
     {
      "text": "For ye shall -- Contra. Exodus 12:33,39."
     }
    ]
   },
   {
    "type": "verse",
    "number": 14,
    "content": [
     {
      "text": "so marred -- The literal rendering is terrible: \"So marred from the form of man was His aspect that His appearance was not that of a son of man\"--i.e. not human--the effect of the brutalities described in Matthew 26:67,68; 27:27-30."
     }
    ]
   }
